0..64 Comment "//! This source defines common declarations for session sources."
65..68 Comment "//!"
69..117 Comment "//! `Seat` defines a recursive session protocol."
118..155 Comment "//! The protocol receives a dispatch."
156..180 Comment "//! The seat can report."
181..207 Comment "//! The seat can continue."
208..232 Comment "//! The seat can retire."
233..236 Comment "//!"
237..269 Comment "//! The seat can send a handoff."
270..304 Comment "//! The handoff ends the protocol."
305..365 Comment "//! `Seat` defines the messages that its protocol exchanges."
366..418 Comment "//! Every session source imports these declarations."
419..479 Comment "//! The checker verifies the protocol and its message types."
480..483 Comment "//!"
484..558 Comment "//! - see: `../worlds/seat-and-operator.gandr` — `Report` crosses worlds"
